name issue_430_video_only_outage_4s
describe video-only call, 4 s outage at 15 s on both paths: video returns about 6.2 s after the last frame, as libwebrtc (parity, #430, the #134 case)
# #430's video-only case (#134, merged into #430). libwebrtc does the same
# (#433's compare-webrtc, seeds 1-10, @ 0d86dcc):
#   metric                ours mean (min-max)       libwebrtc mean (min-max)
#   video.pause_total_ms  6218 (6181-6279)          6189 (6131-6236)
#   video.render_fps      25.26 (25.25-25.28)       25.24 (25.23-25.25)
# Both stacks wait for the receiver's 3 s decode timeout (video_receive_stream2.cc kMaxWaitForFrame, OnDecodableFrameTimeout): the first keyframe request falls in the outage and is lost, the next one is sent 3 s later. The expect lines hold the call at libwebrtc's worst seed plus about 10 %.
# sm_compare runs 80 seeds here (#446): the 10-seed queue p95 cell (67.1 vs 52.7 ms, band +-13.8, behind on 7/10)
# may be seed spread, as the #437 and #410 cells were; 80 seeds place it.
compare_seeds 80
seed 1
duration 40s
audio off
at 0s capacity=1500kbps delay=30ms queue=300ms
at 15s down
at 19s up
reverse at 0s delay=30ms
reverse at 15s down
reverse at 19s up
expect video.pause_total_ms < 6900
expect video.render_fps > 22.7
